  '{tool} is asking this in its own window. Answer it there; this page closes by itself once you do. ({tool} cannot take an answer from here.)': '这道题在 {tool} 软件里等你回答，请到那边答；答完这里会自己关掉。（{tool} 不支持从这里替它作答。）', 'Ask in the terminal and here at the same time': '终端和这里同时出现，哪边先答算哪边', 'Ask here first; the terminal waits': '先在这里答，终端等着',
