  '{url} opens from this machine': '在这台机器上能打开 {url}', '{url} does not open from this machine': '在这台机器上打不开 {url}',
  'Until this is fixed, use {local} here. Check that Tailscale is running on this machine; MagicDNS must be on for short names.': '修好之前，在这台电脑上用 {local}。检查这台机器上的 Tailscale 是否在运行；用短名访问需要开启 MagicDNS。',
  'This computer is not connected to the tailnet, so use {local} here. To open {url} here too, install Tailscale on this computer and log in to the same tailnet.': '这台电脑没有连上 tailnet，在这里请用 {local}。想在这里也打开 {url}，要在这台电脑上安装 Tailscale，并登录同一个 tailnet。',
  'called “{real}” in the tailnet, not “{h}”: another device probably has that name': '在 tailnet 里叫「{real}」，不是「{h}」：很可能已有别的设备占了这个名字',
