  'This computer does not appear to be connected to the tailnet, so http://{real}/ will not open on it; on this computer use {local}. Other devices with Tailscale can open http://{real}/. To open it here too, install Tailscale on this computer and log in to the same tailnet.': '这台电脑看起来没有连上 tailnet，所以在它上面打不开 http://{real}/，请用 {local}。装了 Tailscale 的其他设备可以打开 http://{real}/。想在这台电脑上也打开，要在它上面安装 Tailscale，并登录同一个 tailnet。',
