  'Tick them off here as you go.': '做完一项就在这里勾掉', '{n} to-do left|{n} to-dos left': '{n} 项待办没做完', 'To-do for you: {title}': '要你动手：{title}', 'No open to-dos.': '没有没做完的待办。', 'No answer yet; stopped waiting.': '还没有答复，不等了。', 'If you are in the middle of something, finish it and reply first; then act on these answers.': '用户提交了答复。如果你手上还有事没做完，先做完、答完，再处理这份答复。',
