  'Closed {item}; the page now shows it was decided in the conversation.': '已关闭 {item}，网页上显示为"对话里定了"。', 'Could not close {item}: {why}': '没能关闭 {item}：{why}', 'it is already {state}': '它已经是 {state} 状态',
  'Usage: mydash todos done <project/slug> <item key or the start of its text>…': '用法：mydash todos done <项目/slug> <待办的 key 或开头几个字>…',
