  'not valid JSON; left as is': '不是有效的 JSON，没改', 'bring Codex questions and approval prompts to mydash, and have it re-ask questions it puts in its reply text': 'Codex 的选择题和命令审批到 mydash 来答，回复里用文字问的提醒它改用选择题', 'let mydash ask / asks / approvals / todos reach mydash from the Codex sandbox': '让 mydash ask / asks / approvals / todos 能从 Codex 沙盒里连到 mydash',
  'Usage: mydash ask "<question>" [option …] [--multi] [--json] [--timeout seconds]': '用法：mydash ask "<问题>" [选项 …] [--multi] [--json] [--timeout 秒数]',
