  'When Claude Code or Codex (command line or app) asks you to choose, approve a plan or allow a command, the question comes here too. Claude Code asks in the terminal at the same time, and whichever you answer first counts. Codex asks in its own window first; if you do not answer there, you get a reminder here and on your phone.': 'Claude Code 或 Codex（命令行和软件都算）要你做选择、确认计划、批准命令时，题目也会到这里来。Claude Code 会同时在终端里问，哪边先答算哪边。Codex 先在它自己的窗口里问，你没答的话，这里和手机上会提醒你。',
