  'Needs HTTPS: turn it on for your tailnet in the Tailscale admin (DNS → HTTPS Certificates). mydash picks it up within a minute.': '要先开 HTTPS：在 Tailscale 后台给 tailnet 打开（DNS → HTTPS Certificates）。打开后一分钟内 mydash 会自己发现。',
