  'iPhone: open the HTTPS address in Safari, Share → Add to Home Screen, open mydash from the home screen, then turn it on here.': 'iPhone：用 Safari 打开 HTTPS 网址，点「分享」→「添加到主屏幕」，再从主屏幕打开 mydash，到这里点开启。',
  'No device has turned on web push yet.': '还没有设备开启网页推送。', 'Open mydash over HTTPS to turn this on here:': '要用 HTTPS 打开 mydash 才能在这里开启：',
