  'Add a bot to a group and paste its webhook URL; the service is recognised from the URL. If Feishu or DingTalk signing is on, paste the secret too. For a DingTalk keyword, use mydash.': '在群里加一个机器人，把它的 webhook 网址粘到这里，是哪家会按网址自动认。飞书、钉钉开了「加签」的话，把密钥也填上；钉钉用「自定义关键词」的话，关键词填 mydash。',
