  'This machine publishes locally. {n} token(s) for other machines. Commands: mydash remote token | tokens | revoke | set | off': '这台机器发布到本机。给其他机器的令牌：{n} 个。命令：mydash remote token | tokens | revoke | set | off',
  'Publishing to {url} ({host}) as “{name}”.': '发布到 {url}（{host}），身份「{name}」。',
